{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Singly-linked list/Element insertion", ALGOL 68 solution singly-linked-list-element-insertion.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Singly-linked_list/Element_insertion#ALGOL_68
